{"seq":2,"slug":"test-driven-infrastructure","title":"测试驱动的基础设施","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/foundations/test-driven-infrastructure","wordCount":1179,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"测试驱动的基础设施\">测试驱动的基础设施</h1><p>测试驱动开发（TDD）的核心循环——Red → Green → Refactor——在基础设施领域的映射不是简单的类比，而是需要根据 IaC 的特殊性进行适配。基础设施代码的&quot;编译&quot;是 <code>plan</code>，&quot;运行&quot;是 <code>apply</code>，&quot;断言&quot;是对真实云资源状态的查询。这种差异决定了测试驱动基础设施（Test-Driven Infrastructure, TDI）拥有独特的节奏与工作流。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>TDI（Test-Driven Infrastructure）</strong>：先编写期望状态的测试断言，再编写满足断言的 IaC 代码</li>\n<li><strong>Red-Green-Refactor</strong>：写失败测试 → 最小实现使其通过 → 在测试保护下重构</li>\n<li><strong>Plan-Driven 测试</strong>：通过 <code>command = plan</code> 执行零成本验证</li>\n<li><strong>Apply-Driven 测试</strong>：创建真实资源验证实际行为</li>\n<li><strong>规约先行</strong>：将基础设施需求翻译为可测试断言后再编码</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"tdi-的三阶段循环\">TDI 的三阶段循环</h2><p>传统 TDD 循环在基础设施语境下的对应：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>TDD 阶段</th>\n<th>TDI 对应</th>\n<th>具体动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Red（写失败测试）</td>\n<td>编写断言期望的基础设施状态</td>\n<td>写 <code>.tftest.hcl</code> 或 Go test，定义期望输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Green（最小实现）</td>\n<td>编写刚好让测试通过的 IaC</td>\n<td>编写 <code>main.tf</code> / Pulumi 程序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Refactor（重构）</td>\n<td>在测试保护下改善代码结构</td>\n<td>提取模块、消除重复、优化命名</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[定义期望状态] --&gt; B[编写测试断言]&#10;    B --&gt; C[运行测试 - 红]&#10;    C --&gt; D[编写 IaC 代码]&#10;    D --&gt; E[运行测试 - 绿]&#10;    E --&gt; F{需要重构?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[重构模块结构]&#10;    G --&gt; E&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[提交代码]&#10;    H --&gt; A\">graph LR\n    A[定义期望状态] --&gt; B[编写测试断言]\n    B --&gt; C[运行测试 - 红]\n    C --&gt; D[编写 IaC 代码]\n    D --&gt; E[运行测试 - 绿]\n    E --&gt; F{需要重构?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[重构模块结构]\n    G --&gt; E\n    F --&gt;|否| H[提交代码]\n    H --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"从需求到测试-规约先行\">从需求到测试：规约先行</h2><p>TDI 的起点不是打开编辑器写 Terraform，而是将基础设施需求翻译为可验证的规约。这些规约描述的是<em>期望状态</em>而非实现细节：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"需求：应用层需要一个私有子网，CIDR 为 10.0.1.0/24，&#10;      位于 us-east-1a 可用区，且禁止直接公网出口。&#10;&#10;规约（可测试的断言）：&#10;  1. 子网 CIDR = 10.0.1.0/24&#10;  2. 子网 AZ = us-east-1a&#10;  3. map_public_ip_on_launch = false&#10;  4. 关联的路由表无 0.0.0.0/0 → igw 路由\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>需求：应用层需要一个私有子网，CIDR 为 10.0.1.0/24，</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      位于 us-east-1a 可用区，且禁止直接公网出口。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>规约（可测试的断言）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  1. 子网 CIDR = 10.0.1.0/24</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2. 子网 AZ = us-east-1a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  3. map_public_ip_on_launch = false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  4. 关联的路由表无 0.0.0.0/0 → igw 路由</span></span></code></pre></div><p>将规约翻译为 OpenTofu 原生测试：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"hcl\" data-code=\"# tests/private_subnet.tftest.hcl&#10;variables {&#10;  subnet_cidr = &quot;10.0.1.0/24&quot;&#10;  az          = &quot;us-east-1a&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;run &quot;subnet_cidr_correct&quot; {&#10;  command = plan&#10;  assert {&#10;    condition     = aws_subnet.private.cidr_block == &quot;10.0.1.0/24&quot;&#10;    error_message = &quot;私有子网 CIDR 必须为 10.0.1.0/24&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;run &quot;subnet_no_public_ip&quot; {&#10;  command = plan&#10;  assert {&#10;    condition     = aws_subnet.private.map_public_ip_on_launch == false&#10;    error_message = &quot;私有子网不应自动分配公网 IP&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># tests/private_subnet.tftest.hcl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>variables {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  subnet_cidr = \"10.0.1.0/24\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  az          = \"us-east-1a\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>run \"subnet_cidr_correct\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  command = plan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  assert {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    condition     = aws_subnet.private.cidr_block == \"10.0.1.0/24\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    error_message = \"私有子网 CIDR 必须为 10.0.1.0/24\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>run \"subnet_no_public_ip\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  command = plan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  assert {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    condition     = aws_subnet.private.map_public_ip_on_launch == false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    error_message = \"私有子网不应自动分配公网 IP\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"plan-driven-与-apply-driven-测试\">Plan-Driven 与 Apply-Driven 测试</h2><p>TDI 中存在两种测试执行模式，各有适用场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Plan-Driven</th>\n<th>Apply-Driven</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>执行命令</td>\n<td><code>tofu test</code>（command = plan）</td>\n<td><code>tofu test</code>（command = apply）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源创建</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证精度</td>\n<td>计划值（可能与实际有偏差）</td>\n<td>真实云资源状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行时间</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>按资源计费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合验证</td>\n<td>逻辑分支、输出计算、变量传递</td>\n<td>真实行为、API 返回值、跨资源交互</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Plan-driven 测试覆盖大部分逻辑验证需求，且反馈速度足够支撑 TDI 的快速迭代节奏。Apply-driven 测试用于关键路径的最终确认。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tdi-的实践节奏\">TDI 的实践节奏</h2><p>一个典型的 TDI 会话：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>接收需求</strong>：团队需要一个带 WAF 的 CloudFront 分发</li>\n<li><strong>分解规约</strong>：<ul>\n<li>CloudFront 必须启用 HTTPS（<code>viewer_protocol_policy = &quot;redirect-to-https&quot;</code>）</li>\n<li>WAF Web ACL 必须关联到分发</li>\n<li>源站必须使用 OAC（Origin Access Control）而非过时的 OAI</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>编写测试</strong>：每条规约对应一个 <code>run</code> 块的 <code>assert</code></li>\n<li><strong>运行并确认红色</strong>：测试失败，因为尚无实现</li>\n<li><strong>编写最小 IaC</strong>：刚好让测试通过</li>\n<li><strong>运行并确认绿色</strong>：所有断言通过</li>\n<li><strong>重构</strong>：将 CloudFront + WAF 提取为可复用模块</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"重构的安全网\">重构的安全网</h2><p>TDI 的最大价值不在首次编写，而在后续的重构与演进。当测试套件覆盖了关键行为时，以下重构操作可以安全执行：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>提取模块</strong>：将一组资源封装为独立模块，测试确保输入/输出契约不变</li>\n<li><strong>升级 Provider</strong>：Provider 版本升级后运行完整测试套件，检测行为变更</li>\n<li><strong>迁移到 OpenTofu</strong>：从 Terraform 迁移到 OpenTofu 后验证行为一致性</li>\n<li><strong>环境参数化</strong>：将硬编码值替换为变量，测试确保默认行为不变</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{refactor} = \\frac{T_{covered}}{T_{total}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{refactor}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是重构安全度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{covered}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是被测试覆盖的行为数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{total}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是模块的总行为数。当覆盖率低于 70% 时，重构的风险显著上升。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tdi-与-gitops-的集成\">TDI 与 GitOps 的集成</h2><p>在 GitOps 工作流中，TDI 自然融入 Pull Request 流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Dev as 开发者&#10;    participant Git as Git 仓库&#10;    participant CI as CI 管道&#10;    participant Cloud as 云环境&#10;&#10;    Dev-&gt;&gt;Git: 提交测试 + IaC 代码&#10;    Git-&gt;&gt;CI: 触发 PR 检查&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: 静态分析(tflint, checkov)&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: 单元测试(plan-driven)&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;Cloud: 集成测试(apply + validate + destroy)&#10;    Cloud--&gt;&gt;CI: 测试结果&#10;    CI--&gt;&gt;Git: 状态检查通过/失败&#10;    Git--&gt;&gt;Dev: PR 可合并 / 需修复\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Dev as 开发者\n    participant Git as Git 仓库\n    participant CI as CI 管道\n    participant Cloud as 云环境\n\n    Dev-&gt;&gt;Git: 提交测试 + IaC 代码\n    Git-&gt;&gt;CI: 触发 PR 检查\n    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: 静态分析(tflint, checkov)\n    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: 单元测试(plan-driven)\n    CI-&gt;&gt;Cloud: 集成测试(apply + validate + destroy)\n    Cloud--&gt;&gt;CI: 测试结果\n    CI--&gt;&gt;Git: 状态检查通过/失败\n    Git--&gt;&gt;Dev: PR 可合并 / 需修复</pre><h2 id=\"tdi-的约束与适用边界\">TDI 的约束与适用边界</h2><p>TDI 并非万能。以下场景中，纯 TDI 方法的投资回报率降低：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>一次性基础设施</strong>（如：临时演示环境）——测试的维护成本超过收益</li>\n<li><strong>高度动态的配置</strong>（如：自动伸缩策略的精确行为）——真实行为依赖运行时负载</li>\n<li><strong>第三方服务集成</strong>（如：SaaS API 的可用性）——无法在测试中可靠模拟</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对这些场景，TDI 退化为部分测试覆盖 + 运行时监控的混合策略。关于如何在 CI/CD 中编排这种混合策略，参见 <a href=\"testing-environments-strategies\">测试环境与策略</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>测试驱动基础设施将 TDD 的快速反馈循环适配到 IaC 工作流——通过规约先行、Plan-driven 快速验证和 Apply-driven 真实确认的组合，使基础设施代码在首次编写时就建立信心，在后续重构和演进时拥有安全网。TDI 的价值不在于追求 100% 覆盖率，而在于为关键行为建立可自动化验证的契约。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"测试驱动的基础设施","id":"测试驱动的基础设施"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"TDI 的三阶段循环","id":"tdi-的三阶段循环"},{"level":2,"text":"从需求到测试：规约先行","id":"从需求到测试-规约先行"},{"level":2,"text":"Plan-Driven 与 Apply-Driven 测试","id":"plan-driven-与-apply-driven-测试"},{"level":2,"text":"TDI 的实践节奏","id":"tdi-的实践节奏"},{"level":2,"text":"重构的安全网","id":"重构的安全网"},{"level":2,"text":"TDI 与 GitOps 的集成","id":"tdi-与-gitops-的集成"},{"level":2,"text":"TDI 的约束与适用边界","id":"tdi-的约束与适用边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"基础设施测试金字塔","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/foundations/testing-pyramid-infra"},"next":{"title":"测试环境与策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/foundations/testing-environments-strategies"}}